r/news/2022-world-snooker-championship-schedule-what-todays-order-play/ukx6rk3n5lnncnkl9lcw5txh\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... 10. | 2021 | Snooker Shoot Out | Ryan Day | 0–1 |\\n| Winner | 20. | 2021 | World Snooker Championship (4) | Shaun Murphy | 18–15 |\\n| Winner | 21. | 2022 | English Open (2) | Luca Brecel | 9–6 |\\n| Winner | 22. | 2023 | WST Classic | Pang Junxu | 6–2 |\\n| Runner-up | 11. | 2023 | World Snooker Championship (2) | Luca ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Selby\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2022 World Snooker Championship - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2021-05-03\\n---\\ntournament_name: 2022 Betfred World Snooker Championship\\nlogo: World Snooker Championship 2015 Logo.png\\ndates: 16 April 2022\\nvenue: Crucible Theatre\\nlocation: Sheffield\\ncountry: England\\norganisation: World Snooker Tour\\nformat: Ranking event\\ntotal prize fund: £2, 395, 000\\nwinners ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_World_Snooker_Championship\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d8\"},\"ref\":\"d8\",\"snippet\":\" ... IMG at the World Snooker Championship 2024\\nauthor: George Bevir\\ndate: 2024-05-03\\n---\\nLive from the Crucible: IMG at the World Snooker Championship 2024\\n\\nWhen the World Snooker Championship trophy is lifted in a few days' time, a significant chapter in the tournament's illustrious history will ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.svgeurope.org/blog/headlines/live-from-the-crucible-img-at-the-world-snooker-championship-2024/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"