-place match, final |\\n| 2024 | 16 | 32 | 32 | 4 groups of 4, quarter-finals, semi-finals, 3rd-place match, final |\\n\\n;Notes\\n\\nThe tournament was previously known as Campeonato Sudamericano de Futbol (South American Championship of ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Copa_Am%C3%A9rica\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... a rise in performances from the region hinted by the FIFA World Ranking.\\n\\nAfter a 16-year hiatus from guest nations, Qatar were invited and participated in the 2021 CONCACAF Gold Cup, losing in the semi-finals to the United States. Qatar also participated in the 2023 Gold ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CONCACAF_Gold_Cup\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2015) |\\n\\n| 13 | Anthony McGill (Scotland) | Semi-finalist (2020) |\\n\\n| 14 | Jack Lisowski (England) | 2nd round (2018 & 2021) |\\n\\n| 15 | Mark Allen (Northern Ireland) | Semi-finalist (2009) |\\n\\n| 16 | Yao Bingtao (China) | 2nd round (2020 & 2021) |\\n\\nWhen is the 2022 World Snooker Championship final?\\n\\nThe final will start on May 1 and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.sportingnews.com/in/snooker/news/2022-world-snooker-championship-schedule-what-todays-order-play/ukx6rk3n5lnncnkl9lcw5txh\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d43\"},\"ref\":\"d43\",\"snippet\":\" ... in group, progressed | First in group, progressed |\\n| 2 July 2021 | Quarter-finals | Estádio Engenhão, Rio de Janeiro | | 1–0 | Paquetá Gabriel Jesus |\\n| 5 July 2021 | Semi-finals | Estádio Engenhão, Rio de Janeiro | | 1–0 | Paquetá |\\n| 10 July 2021 | Fi